get that straightened out before I try to weigh in any further on this
topic.

So, currently {cu} will break you out to the next appropriate bridi (i.e.
the next bridi that is waiting for a selbri) and not *necessarily* out to
the "main" bridi?  If this is true, then I understand why people are asking
why {vau} would not work.

